txtql::lint::nested_repetition

  ⚠ nested unlimited repetition
   ╭─[query:1:8]
 1 │ TEXT = 1 TO n (1 TO n WORD)
   ·        ───┬──  ───┬──
   ·           │       ╰── inner repetition
   ·           ╰── outer repetition
   ╰────
  help: `1 TO n (1 TO n x)` can split the text in exponentially many ways; add a separator or a
        literal to anchor the inner repetition
